{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mat-23-1","title":"Matthew 23:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ admonishes the people to follow the good doctrine, not the evil examples, of the Scribes and Pharisees. 5 His disciples must beware of their ambition. 13 He denounces eight woes against their hypocrisy and blindness, 34 and prophesies of the destruction of Jerusalem.</p>\n<p>15:10-20; Mr 7:14; Lu 12:1,57; 20:45</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-2","title":"Matthew 23:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Ne 8:4-8; Mal 2:7; Mr 12:38; Lu 20:46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-3","title":"Matthew 23:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>whatsoever. 15:2-9; Ex 18:19,20,23; De 4:5; 5:27; 17:9-12; 2Ch 30:12; Ac 5:29, Ro 13:1 for. 21:30; Ps 50:16-20; Ro 2:19-24; 2Ti 3:5; Tit 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-4","title":"Matthew 23:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>23; 11:28-30; Lu 11:46; Ac 15:10,28; Ga 6:13; Re 2:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-5","title":"Matthew 23:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>all. 6:1-16; 2Ki 10:16; Lu 16:15; 20:47; 21:1; Joh 5:44; 7:18; 12:43 Php 1:15; 2:3; 2Th 2:4 they make. De 6:8; Pr 3:3; 6:21-23 the borders. 9:20; Nu 15:38,39; De 22:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-6","title":"Matthew 23:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>20:21; Pr 25:6,7; Mr 12:38,39; Lu 11:43-54; 14:7-11; 20:46,47 Ro 12:10; Jas 2:1-4; 3Jo 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-7","title":"Matthew 23:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Rabbi. Joh 1:38,49; 3:2,26; 6:25; 20:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-8","title":"Matthew 23:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>be. 10; 2Co 1:24; 4:5; Jas 3:1; 1Pe 5:3 one. 10:25; 17:5; 26:49; Joh 13:13,14; Ro 14:9,10; 1Co 1:12,13; 3:3-5 all. Lu 22:32; Eph 3:15; Col 1:1,2; Re 1:9; 19:10; 22:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-9","title":"Matthew 23:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>call. 2Ki 2:12; 6:21; 13:14; Job 32:21,22; Ac 22:1; 1Co 4:15; 1Ti 5:1,2 Heb 12:9 for. 6:8,9,32; Mal 1:6; Ro 8:14-17; 2Co 6:18; 1Jo 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-11","title":"Matthew 23:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>20:26,27; Mr 10:43,44; Lu 22:26,27; Joh 13:14,15; 1Co 9:19; 2Co 4:5 2Co 11:23; Ga 5:13; Php 2:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-12","title":"Matthew 23:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>5:3; 18:4; Job 22:29; Ps 138:6; Pr 15:33; 16:18,19; 29:23; Isa 57:15 Da 4:37; Lu 1:51,52; 14:11; 18:14; Jas 4:6; 1Pe 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-13","title":"Matthew 23:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>woe. 14,15,27,29; Isa 9:14,15; 33:14; Zec 11:17; Lu 11:43,44 for ye shut. 21:31,32; Lu 11:52; Joh 7:46-52; 9:22,24,34; Ac 4:17,18; 5:28,40 Ac 8:1; 13:8; 1Th 2:15,16; 2Ti 3:8; 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-14","title":"Matthew 23:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>for ye.Josephus says that this sect pretended to a more exact knowledge of the law, on which account the women were subject to them, as pretending to be dear to God.</p>\n<p>Ex 22:22-24; Job 22:9; 31:16-20; Mr 12:40; Lu 20:47; 2Ti 3:6 Tit 1:10,11; 2Pe 2:14,15 long.That these were long we learn from Bab. Berachoth, where we are told that the very religious prayed nine hours a day.</p>\n<p>therefore. 33-36; 11:24; Lu 12:48; Jas 3:1; 2Pe 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-15","title":"Matthew 23:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>for. Ga 4:17; 6:12 proselyte. Es 8:17; Ac 2:10; 13:43 ye make. Joh 8:44; Ac 13:10; 14:2,19; 17:5,6,13; Eph 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-16","title":"Matthew 23:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>ye blind. 17,19,24,26; 15:14; Isa 56:10,11; Joh 9:39-41 Whosoever shall swear by the temple. 5:33,34; Jas 5:12 it is. 15:5,6; Mr 7:10-13 he is. Ga 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-17","title":"Matthew 23:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Ye fools. Ps 94:8 or. 19; Ex 30:26-29; Nu 16:38,39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-18","title":"Matthew 23:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>guilty. or, debtor. 15 or bound.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-19","title":"Matthew 23:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>or. Ex 29:37; 30:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-21","title":"Matthew 23:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>and by. 1Ki 8:13,27; 2Ch 6:2; 7:2; Ps 26:8; 132:13,14; Eph 2:22; Col 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-22","title":"Matthew 23:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>by the. 5:34; Ps 11:4; Isa 66:1; Ac 7:49; Re 4:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-23","title":"Matthew 23:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>for. Lu 11:42 anise. Gr. [anethon ,] dill.Dill is a species of plant of the pentandria digynia class, growing native in Spain and Portugal. The root is fusiform and long; stems, erect-groved, jointed, branched, and about two feet in height; leaves, doubly pinnated, sweet and odorous; flowers, flat, terminal umbels; corolla, five ovate, concave, yellow petals, with apexes inflected; germen, like that of fennel; seeds, scarcely the length of a carraway seed, but broader and flatter, of a brown colour, aromatic, sweetish odour, and warmish, pungent taste.</p>\n<p>cummin. Gr. [kuminom ]Cummin is a plant of the same class as dill: it rises eight or ten inches on a slender round procumbent, branching stem; leaves, a dark green, narrow, linear, and pointed; flowers, purple, in numerous four rayed umbels; corolla, five unequal petals, inflected, and notched at the apex; seeds, oblong, striated, of a brown colour, strong, heavy odour, and warm, bitterish taste.</p>\n<p>the weightier. 9:13; 12:7; 22:37-40; 1Sa 15:22; Pr 21:3; Jer 22:15,16; Ho 6:6 Mic 6:8; Ga 5:22,23 these. 5:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-24","title":"Matthew 23:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>7:4; 15:2-6; 19:24; 27:6-8; Lu 6:7-10; Joh 18:28,40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-25","title":"Matthew 23:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>for. 15:19,20; Mr 7:4-13; Lu 11:39,40 full. Isa 28:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-26","title":"Matthew 23:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>cleanse. 12:33; Isa 55:7; Jer 4:14; 13:27; Eze 18:31; Lu 6:45; 2Co 7:1 Heb 10:22; Jas 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-27","title":"Matthew 23:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>like. Isa 58:1,2; Lu 11:44; Ac 23:3 sepulchres. Nu 19:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-28","title":"Matthew 23:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>ye also. 5; 1Sa 16:7; Ps 51:6; Jer 17:9,10; Lu 16:15; Heb 4:12,13 but. 12:34,35; 15:19,20; Mr 7:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-29","title":"Matthew 23:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>ye build. Lu 11:47,48; Ac 2:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-30","title":"Matthew 23:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>the blood. 34,35; 21:35,36; 2Ch 36:15; Jer 2:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-31","title":"Matthew 23:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>witnesses. Jos 24:22; Job 15:5,6; Ps 64:8; Lu 19:22 that. Ac 7:51,52; 1Th 2:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-32","title":"Matthew 23:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>the measure. Ge 15:16; Nu 32:14; Zec 5:6-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-33","title":"Matthew 23:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>serpents. 3:7; 12:34; 21:34,35; Ge 3:15; Ps 58:3-5; Isa 57:3,4; Lu 3:7 Joh 8:44; 2Co 11:3; Re 12:9 how. 14; Heb 2:3; 10:29; 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-34","title":"Matthew 23:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>I send. 10:16; 28:19,20; Lu 11:49; 24:47; Joh 20:21; Ac 1:8; 1Co 12:3-11 Eph 4:8-12 prophets. Ac 11:27; 13:1; 15:32; Re 11:10 and wise. Pr 11:30; 1Co 2:6; 3:10; Col 1:28 scribes. 13:52 ye. 10:16,17; Joh 16:2; Ac 5:40; 7:51,52,58,59; 9:1,2; 12:2; 14:19 Ac 22:19,20; 2Co 11:24,25; 1Th 2:16; Heb 11:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-35","title":"Matthew 23:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>upon. Ge 9:5,6; Nu 35:33; De 21:7,8; 2Ki 21:16; 24:4; Isa 26:21 Jer 2:30,34; 26:15,23; La 4:13,14; Re 18:24 the blood of righteous. Ge 4:8; Heb 11:4; 12:24; 1Jo 3:11,12 unto. 2Ch 24:20-22; Zec 1:1; Lu 11:51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-36","title":"Matthew 23:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>24:34; Eze 12:21-28; Mr 13:30,31; Lu 21:32,33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-37","title":"Matthew 23:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>Jerusalem. Jer 4:14; 6:8; Lu 13:34; Re 11:8 thou. 30; 5:12; 21:35,36; 22:6; 2Ch 24:21,22; Ne 9:26; Jer 2:30; 26:23 Mr 12:3-6; Lu 20:11-14; Ac 7:51,52; 1Th 2:15; Re 11:7; 17:6 how. 2Ch 36:15,16; Ps 81:8-11; Jer 6:16,17; 11:7,8; 25:3-7; 35:15 Jer 42:9-13; 44:4; Zec 1:4 even. De 32:11,12; Ru 2:12; Ps 17:8; 36:7; 57:1; 63:7; 91:4 and ye. 22:3; Pr 1:24-31; Isa 50:2; Ho 11:2,7; Lu 14:17-20; 15:28; 19:14-44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-38","title":"Matthew 23:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>24:2; 2Ch 7:20,21; Ps 69:24; Isa 64:10-12; Jer 7:9-14; Da 9:26 Zec 11:1,2,6; 14:1,2; Mr 13:14; Lu 13:35; 19:43,44; 21:6,20,24 Ac 6:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-23-39","title":"Matthew 23:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Ye shall not. Ho 3:4; Lu 2:26-30; 10:22,23; 17:22; Joh 8:21,24,56; 14:9,19 Blessed. 21:9; Ps 118:26; Isa 40:9-11; Zec 12:10; Ro 11:25; 2Co 3:14-18</p>"}]}